	)
	(text "D701/D702 KT-0603G/R from +3V3 through 1k, sunk by the MCU (GPIO low = on): green VF 2.6-3.1 V at 5 mA,\n  so ~0.5 mA (dim, visible indoors; HW-UI-001, B8); red ~1.3 mA. Pins sink well under 20 mA.\nSW701 to GND with R703 10k pull-up; firmware debounces. No series R / RC on the button: the parts list has\n  none and the button is on the board, not on a cable (deviation from mcu-circuit-design §11, D-023).\nJ701 Tag-Connect TC2030-NL footprint (no part fitted): VTref +3V3, SWDIO PA13, SWCLK PA14, SWO PB3, nRESET.\n  STM32 has internal pulls on SWDIO/SWCLK (mcu-circuit-design §5). TC2030 pin 3 drives NRST (open drain).\nH701-H704 M3 NPTH at the corners; FID701-FID703 1 mm pad / 2 mm mask fiducials for JLCPCB assembly."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 118.11 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6ead15ab-0a9b-53b0-a3e4-771f457f7094")
	)
